{:edb/db-before-t 1746 :edb/db-after-t 1747 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535059 50 #inst "2026-10-08T15:48:58.360Z" 13194139535059 true] [17592186068663 1020 #edb/ref 17592186328911 13194139535059 true] [17592186068663 1020 #edb/ref 17592186328918 13194139535059 true] [17592186068663 1020 #edb/ref 17592186328925 13194139535059 true] [17592186068729 1020 #edb/ref 17592186328932 13194139535059 true] [17592186068729 1020 #edb/ref 17592186328939 13194139535059 true] [17592186328911 1017 #edb/ref 17592186328912 13194139535059 true] [17592186328911 1089 "q-12916" 13194139535059 true] [17592186328911 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139535059 true] [17592186328911 1100 "Calculate $\\int {e}^{-x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139535059 true] [17592186328911 1113 #uuid "125a7bce-1c61-51c2-a4e1-960865f49020" 13194139535059 true] [17592186328911 1145 "To use integration by parts, let's suppose that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u={e}^{-x}\\, & ⇒\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-{e}^{-x}\\,, \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\, & ⇒\\,v=\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, using the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & =\\int {e}^{-x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int u\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={e}^{-x}(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)-\\int (-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)(-{e}^{-x})\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-{e}^{-x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\int {e}^{-x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-{e}^{-x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-J.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAgain, we can use integration by parts to evaluate\n\n$$\nJ=\\int {e}^{-x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nTo do this, let's suppose that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u={e}^{-x}\\, & ⇒\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-{e}^{-x}\\,, \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\, & ⇒\\,v=\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}J & =\\int {e}^{-x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int u\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={e}^{-x}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)-\\int (\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)(-{e}^{-x})\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={e}^{-x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\int {e}^{-x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={e}^{-x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+I.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting this back into our equation for $I,$ we can subsequently solve for $I.$ We remember to add a constant of integration $C$ at the end.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & =-{e}^{-x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-J \\\\ I & =-{e}^{-x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-({e}^{-x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+I) \\\\ I & =-{e}^{-x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-{e}^{-x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-I \\\\ 2I & =-{e}^{-x}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-{e}^{-x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x \\\\ I & =-\\frac{{e}^{-x}}{2}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535059 true] [17592186328912 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328913 13194139535059 true] [17592186328912 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328914 13194139535059 true] [17592186328912 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328915 13194139535059 true] [17592186328912 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328916 13194139535059 true] [17592186328912 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328917 13194139535059 true] [17592186328912 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535059 true] [17592186328912 1041 "selection" 13194139535059 true] [17592186328912 1104 #edb/ref 17592186328916 13194139535059 true] [17592186328912 1110 #uuid "71893019-d9b0-5516-89c8-9e0982918b21" 13194139535059 true] [17592186328913 1034 "{e}^{-x}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)+C" 13194139535059 true] [17592186328913 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535059 true] [17592186328913 1111 #uuid "b4a72ba7-4732-59f4-af04-51316ec34a65" 13194139535059 true] [17592186328914 1034 "{e}^{-x}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-